s on tcp/80 and tcp/443, confirmed via curl and dnf that remotes were unreachable, then installed `tree` successfully using only the local-file repo. Reverted the firewall rules and re-enabled the original remote repos, verified remote reachability restored. Completed the mandatory single-node restart protocol: captured boot_id baseline (513c865e...), rebooted node1 via `shutdown -r now` (ack returned before disconnect), polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id (bcd7d486...), and verified post-restart that tree remained installed, local repo storage/metadata were intact, remote repos were enabled/reachable again, and no leftover firewall rules remained.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Captured baseline OS/repo/network state on node1\",\"Installed createrepo_c and dnf-plugins-core\",\"Downloaded tree-1.8.0-10.el9.x86_64.rpm into /srv/local-repo while network was reachable\",\"Ran createrepo_c to build repo metadata\",\"Created /etc/yum.repos.d/local-file.repo pointing to file:///srv/local-repo\",\"Disabled all almalinux-*.repo remote repos (backed up originals to /root/repo-backup)\",\"Added iptables REJECT rules for tcp/80 and tcp/443 to make remote repos genuinely unreachable\",\"Confirmed remote unreachability via curl and dnf repolist\",\"Installed tree package using only the local-file repo (--disablerepo=* --enablerepo=local-file)\",\"Verified installation via rpm -q, which, tree --version\",\"Removed iptables REJECT rules\",\"Restored original almalinux-*.repo files (enabled=1)\",\"Confirmed remote reachability restored\",\"Captured pre-restart boot_id and health baseline\",\"Rebooted node1 via sudo shutdown -r now with backgrounded ack\",\"Polled node1 until exec succeeded again\",\"Verified boot_id changed post-restart\",\"Verified tree package, local repo storage/metadata, remote repo config, and firewall state all recovered post-restart\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"Local package repository served from local storage with correct metadata\",\"comm